Defect: SMI-INVALID-DATE https://pysnmp.github.io/pysmi/stable/mib-defects.html#smi-invalid-date

LAST-UPDATED reads 2016083000Z, eleven characters, which the SMI takes
as the two-digit-year form and which is not a date in it. Read as a
four-digit year it is August 30, 2016 with two digits of the time
missing, a week before the module's newest REVISION of September 6,
2016. The repair writes that day at 00:00.

No publisher on record serves this module, so the baseline is the text
this repository carried before the repair; which publication that was is
not recovered.

--- a/VERITAS-APPLIANCE-MONITORING-MIB
+++ b/VERITAS-APPLIANCE-MONITORING-MIB
@@ -6,7 +6,7 @@
 
 
 applianceMonitoringMib MODULE-IDENTITY
-LAST-UPDATED "2016083000Z"
+LAST-UPDATED "201608300000Z"
 ORGANIZATION "Veritas Technologies LLC"
 CONTACT-INFO "500 East Middlefield Road
 Mountain View, CA 94043 US
